# ~chewygumxx/dorothy.git
# ::: :/.env.example
#
#

# Copy to .env and fill in one of the two auth methods below, encrypted
# via `dotenvx set KEY value` (or `dotenvx encrypt` after filling it in).
# The private key lives in Dotenvx Armor or a gitignored .env.keys. .env
# itself is committed, so it must never hold a plaintext value.

# Pay-per-token API auth.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Claude Pro/Max subscription auth. Mint with `claude setup-token`.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
